---
title: UC03 Sequence diagram · 523C0007 · AI-assisted
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor C as :Customer
    participant OC as :OrderController
    participant H as :Hub
    participant PC as :PriceCalculator
    participant V as :Voucher
    participant O as :Order
    participant P as :Payment
    participant G as :IPaymentGateway
    C->>OC: Quote(form)
    OC->>H: IsBusy(rules)
    H-->>OC: false
    OC->>V: CheckUsable(foodSubtotal, today, usedBefore)
    V-->>OC: null (usable)
    OC->>PC: Quote(hub, lines, distanceKm, voucher)
    PC->>PC: DeliveryFee(distanceKm)
    PC->>H: IsQuiet(rules)
    PC->>V: DiscountFor(foodSubtotal)
    PC-->>OC: quote: PriceQuote
    OC-->>C: Quote view (full price)
    C->>OC: Place(form)
    Note over OC: validates and prices again (availability, voucher or load may have changed)
    OC->>O: Order.Place(customer, hub, address, lines, quote, method, now)
    O-->>OC: order (Placed)
    OC->>P: new Payment(method, total)
    opt method is EWallet or Card
        OC->>G: Authorise(method, total, customerRef)
        G-->>OC: gatewayRef
        OC->>P: Authorised(gatewayRef)
    end
    OC-->>C: redirect to Details(orderId)
